{"id":"ca566714b52a0471","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-top3-uniform-space.md","title":"ZFC Top3 Uniform Space","display":"df-zfc-top3-uniform-space — ZFC Top3 Uniform Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top3-uniform-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top3-uniform-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top3-uniform-space — ZFC Top3 Uniform Space","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-rel-composition.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top3-uniform-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top3-uniform-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top3-uniform-space — ZFC Top3 Uniform Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93950a9b94411f43\" href=\"?note=93950a9b94411f43\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b653ee0494f3a15d\" href=\"?note=b653ee0494f3a15d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-rel-composition.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-rel-composition.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f153d56390f34389\" href=\"?note=f153d56390f34389\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal U\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\\)</span> is the proper set-filter predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S\\)</span> is the diagonal predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"93950a9b94411f43\" href=\"?note=93950a9b94411f43\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelComposition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelComposition}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S\\)</span> are the relation-operation predicates (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b653ee0494f3a15d\" href=\"?note=b653ee0494f3a15d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-rel-composition.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-rel-composition.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f153d56390f34389\" href=\"?note=f153d56390f34389\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3UniformSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3UniformSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3UniformSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(X\\times X,\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\Delta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S(\\Delta,X)\n\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal U\\;(\\Delta\\subseteq E)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Bigl(\\forall E\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists W\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists C\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{ZfcRelComposition}_S(C,W,W)\\land C\\subseteq E)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Bigl(\\forall E\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists F\\in\\mathcal U\\;\n\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(F,E,X,X)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top3\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3UniformSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(X\\times X,\\mathcal U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\Delta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S(\\Delta,X)\n\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal U\\;(\\Delta\\subseteq E)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Bigl(\\forall E\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists W\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists C\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{ZfcRelComposition}_S(C,W,W)\\land C\\subseteq E)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Bigl(\\forall E\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists F\\in\\mathcal U\\;\n\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(F,E,X,X)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every entourage contains the diagonal, admits a compositional square root, and is closed under converse; all relation operations are represented by sourced predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"93950a9b94411f43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-rel-composition.md","status":"resolved","id":"b653ee0494f3a15d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-rel-composition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"f153d56390f34389","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S$ is the proper set-filter predicate (see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"93950a9b94411f43","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S$ is the diagonal predicate (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md]])","embed"